== create demobank-trust-2610070616 (SEV-SNP n2d-standard-4) and demobank-core-2610070616 (e2-standard-2) in us-central1-c
== copy programs and sources
== install both (Veraison builds on the trust zone)
== trust zone: TLS, the workload CA, the configuration (RATS model: passport)
== core: the ledger trusts the bank's workload CA for client logins
== the fraud service's API key goes to the bank's Vault (piped machine to machine, never written here)
== trust zone: start
== up: demobank-trust-2610070616, demobank-core-2610070616
== gcp-snp: create demobank-pay-070623-gcp-snp (--machine-type=n2d-standard-2 --min-cpu-platform=AMD Milan --confidential-compute-type=SEV_SNP --maintenance-policy=TERMINATE)
== gcp-snp: run the payment service
== gcp-snp: delete demobank-pay-070623-gcp-snp
== gcp-tdx: create demobank-pay-070626-gcp-tdx (--machine-type=c3-standard-4 --confidential-compute-type=TDX --maintenance-policy=TERMINATE)
== gcp-tdx: run the payment service
== gcp-tdx: delete demobank-pay-070626-gcp-tdx
== aws-snp: key pair, security group (SSH from this address only), c6a.large with AmdSevSnp=enabled
== aws-snp: GCP firewall rule demobank-aws-062835 admits 18.227.13.220 to the EST server, the ledger and the fraud service only
== aws-snp: run the payment service (over the internet to the bank in GCP)
== aws-snp: terminate, delete the security group, key pair and firewall rule
== ordinary: create demobank-pay-070630-ordinary (--machine-type=e2-small)
== ordinary: run the payment service
== ordinary: delete demobank-pay-070630-ordinary
== unapproved: create demobank-pay-070633-unapproved (--machine-type=n2d-standard-4 --min-cpu-platform=AMD Milan --confidential-compute-type=SEV_SNP --maintenance-policy=TERMINATE)
== unapproved: run the payment service
== unapproved: delete demobank-pay-070633-unapproved
== delete demobank-core-2610070616 (us-central1-c)
== delete demobank-trust-2610070616 (us-central1-c)
